orld units; label text near-black #231F20, serif italic subscripts. Label placement: 'Tangent plane at P0(x0, y0, z0)' two lines, centered above and slightly left of the dot; 'Curve C passes through P0(x0, y0, z0)' three lines at lower-left, beside where the red curve descends the front of the dome; italic 'S' at the lower-right skirt of the orange surface.",
