// dome rim            → Line loop along domain boundary, #D9663F
// tangent plane       → PlaneGeometry(7.6,6.8) displaced to z0-0.264(x-x0)-0.04(y-y0), MeshBasicMaterial #D6EAF6 op .45 DoubleSide depthWrite:false
// plane border        → LineLoop #C8D5DC
